eadb-1a82-5da8-9100-a3eab9dc8ab8" :question/math-academy-id "q-129550" :question/problem "${\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}y\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}y\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}y[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}y{[-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x]}_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}y[-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡0]\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}y\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}y\\,\\text{d}y & ={[\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}]}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{{2}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =2-\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129550/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "16601513-9b74-5cec-9af6-2d99b98e1ab3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129550"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73578/selection/82f0679237d603c9b88d77fbc6f240065a24a3716631fab4d9f58426a7f011e5" :answer/id #uuid "06c9d934-dee0-5e45-8999-42c192435238" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73578/selection/8d714c1fd416e58da765395a7a57c526e1b97a45c41a59520f74d433a1e9ba87" :answer/id #uuid "931a8630-ae95-5f6e-8989-ed07faa969f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73578/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" :answer/id #uuid "652d3777-5b3b-54fa-8534-6384fcccf2f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73578/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" :answer/id #uuid "210c9732-2e73-5c0c-99cd-1fd5efcd5e13" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73578/selection/fb062ca592ca54d47ac3219efc1dcc598f09d92894ed2aa558c1c7bf06e25bd5" :answer/id #uuid "654ca27c-0edf-5431-a2ba-0d0da5b6a933" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73578/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1a122284-d8dd-5afb-9e25-bbe993f43898" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73578/selection/8d714c1fd416e58da765395a7a57c526e1b97a45c41a59520f74d433a1e9ba87" :answer-field/choices ["q-73578/selection/82f0679237d603c9b88d77fbc6f240065a24a3716631fab4d9f58426a7f011e5" "q-73578/selection/8d714c1fd416e58da765395a7a57c526e1b97a45c41a59520f74d433a1e9ba87" "q-73578/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" "q-73578/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" "q-73578/selection/fb062ca592ca54d47ac3219efc1dcc598f09d92894ed2aa558c1c7bf06e25bd5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73578" :question/id #uuid "5d75c934-4b2e-5a66-8cae-88fc5a6df561" :question/math-academy-id "q-73578" :question/problem "Evaluate the repeated integral\n${\\int }_{0}^{1/2}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}[{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}[{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}{[-\\frac{1}{x}]}_{1}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}(-\\frac{1}{2}-(-1))\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}\\text{d}y & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡y]_{0}^{1/2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{\\pi }{6}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{12}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73578/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "16601513-9b74-5cec-9af6-2d99b98e1ab3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73578"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129549/selection/e1ed32369069e52fec9a96c8eaa5974ebb1e0a565e3dec7fa6f80de8b092818b" :answer/id #uuid "a5b954ca-bfb8-5f05-b794-e7483543c9f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129549/selection/e881b797109c704cca7d13950ea4f165843e6dce5d8a796a411a5d714542765f" :answer/id #uuid "29d05e24-e551-5cbd-9c62-39c0227ffae3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{4}{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129549/selection/b480293dbd42474d106d7c06e1cee52968fad1e2bb783802fd69e592ca027b11" :answer/id #uuid "4d098a7e-d70f-5bc0-8921-26ca679de49f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129549/selection/a2f6a61b26c9b21274b850392174ed23088562f19fd3dd8faa53fa3d298a85ef" :answer/id #uuid "2cf2214f-7fbc-5de0-bbd3-2d2d218167ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129549/selection/9a06e6dd9bd381328db18e7595e1996d603184ee47cbc78988c0b62fcd8295dc" :answer/id #uuid "45242f4d-4225-5667-a0e4-cc82a69c00b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{2}{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129549/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "75822314-1f35-54ad-af45-1e19b05d6edd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129549/selection/e881b797109c704cca7d13950ea4f165843e6dce5d8a796a411a5d714542765f" :answer-field/choices ["q-129549/selection/e1ed32369069e52fec9a96c8eaa5974ebb1e0a565e3dec7fa6f80de8b092818b" "q-129549/selection/e881b797109c704cca7d13950ea4f165843e6dce5d8a796a411a5d714542765f" "q-129549/selection/b480293dbd42474d106d7c06e1cee52968fad1e2bb783802fd69e592ca027b11" "q-129549/selection/a2f6a61b26c9b21274b850392174ed23088562f19fd3dd8faa53fa3d298a85ef" "q-129549/selection/9a06e6dd9bd381328db18e7595e1996d603184ee47cbc78988c0b62fcd8295dc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129549" :question/id #uuid "a914a731-2557-5830-aa4d-f86a434e3214" :question/math-academy-id "q-129549" :question/problem "${\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{(x+y)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant. \n\nMaking a substitution $x+y=u,$ $\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u,$ we get.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{(x+y)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{(x+y)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}[{\\int }_{y}^{1+y}\\frac{1}{{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}{[-\\frac{1}{u}]}_{y}^{1+y}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}(-\\frac{1}{y+1}+\\frac{1}{y})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}[\\frac{1}{y}-\\frac{1}{y+1}]\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}[\\frac{1}{y}-\\frac{1}{y+1}]\\,\\text{d}y & =[\\operatorname{ln}⁡y-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(y+1)]_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{y}{y+1}){|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{2}{3})-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{2}{3})+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 2) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{4}{3})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-129549/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "16601513-9b74-5cec-9af6-2d99b98e1ab3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129549"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73583/selection/09e535b811e1e7584404784c7ac4f577a3ed9805710046fc8fb895ffb3de13a0" :answer/id #uuid "04f0322a-06f2-5fdd-a36b-05129c510cb7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\pi }{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73583/selection/1a4ee89f0618612cc5673272ad35e8d4625ee9ed24d34bd6027e2e3a826aae92" :answer/id #uuid "dade62a3-48de-5fc8-bcca-93569ec08e60" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3\\pi }{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73583/selection/82f0679237d603c9b88d77fbc6f240065a24a3716631fab4d9f58426a7f011e5" :answer/id #uuid "7efda17f-b0b1-5dc4-a8ac-9f1416cc2781" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73583/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" :answer/id #uuid "b7e8d490-3834-5524-8a93-33e222d82b31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73583/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" :answer/id #uuid "02b37091-4db1-5ec6-bc07-80cfa2dc04b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73583/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d46b802f-d1d4-5766-9163-99f5fb42ea26" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73583/selection/09e535b811e1e7584404784c7ac4f577a3ed9805710046fc8fb895ffb3de13a0" :answer-field/choices ["q-73583/selection/09e535b811e1e7584404784c7ac4f577a3ed9805710046fc8fb895ffb3de13a0" "q-73583/selection/1a4ee89f0618612cc5673272ad35e8d4625ee9ed24d34bd6027e2e3a826aae92" "q-73583/selection/82f0679237d603c9b88d77fbc6f240065a24a3716631fab4d9f58426a7f011e5" "q-73583/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" "q-73583/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73583" :question/id #uuid "61b00e5d-d3ee-52de-a72c-6ea3af391d5a" :question/math-academy-id "q-73583" :question/problem "Evaluate the repeated integral\n${\\int }_{1/3}^{1/4}{\\int }_{1/3}^{\\sqrt{3}/3}\\frac{3}{{y}^{2}(1+9{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1/3}^{1/4}[{\\int }_{1/3}^{\\sqrt{3}/3}\\frac{3}{{y}^{2}(1+9{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{1/3}^{1/4}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}[{\\int }_{1/3}^{\\sqrt{3}/3}\\frac{3}{(1+(3x)^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1/3}^{1/4}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(3x)]_{1/3}^{\\sqrt{3}/3}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1/3}^{1/4}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(1))\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1/3}^{1/4}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}(\\frac{\\pi }{3}-\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1/3}^{1/4}\\frac{\\pi }{12{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1/3}^{1/4}\\frac{\\pi }{12{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}y & ={[-\\frac{\\pi }{12y}]}_{1/3}^{1/4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\pi }{12\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}}+\\frac{\\pi }{12\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\pi }{3}+\\frac{\\pi }{4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\pi }{12}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73583/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "16601513-9b74-5cec-9af6-2d99b98e1ab3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73583"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-37951/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" :answer/id #uuid "409029ae-4dc8-5bf3-b5c8-87c74550a6b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37951/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" :answer/id #uuid "f36ea682-9013-575a-aae0-e8b6d23fccf5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37951/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "e4692e33-fc62-5914-a8a2-37395d57dc51" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37951/selection/9e11fa4df3725c69efaf2fb0a82d90e47a4519d002f721e23606c3d6290fb02c" :answer/id #uuid "070fe14f-c904-500e-823c-e55e7b8d1a23" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37951/selection/75d4bf82dfc61c34c77bbbf7bd5b3bd55806108bbef22fc9bcd32571f4f3b0b8" :answer/id #uuid "6cc9376c-f595-5a24-9ea7-535552dcdc52" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-37951/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2e863687-7514-571c-aa1f-454dea7fbfa4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-37951/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" :answer-field/choices ["q-37951/selection/e0bd991ac2e2f2a23ec920e03c6d5103be6b20c12a25d724ab290d4ba5292c3e" "q-37951/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" "q-37951/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-37951/selection/9e11fa4df3725c69efaf2fb0a82d90e47a4519d002f721e23606c3d6290fb02c" "q-37951/selection/75d4bf82dfc61c34c77bbbf7bd5b3bd55806108bbef22fc9bcd32571f4f3b0b8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-37951" :question/id #uuid "c4e727bd-8fd5-54cc-b4fe-00c16c127b2e" :question/math-academy-id "q-37951" :question/problem "Evaluate the repeated integral\n${\\int }_{-2}^{-1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-2}^{-1}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{-2}^{-1}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{1}{(1+{x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{-1}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}[\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x]_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{-1}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡\\sqrt{3}-\\operatorname{arctan}⁡0)\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{-1}\\frac{1}{{y}^{2}}(\\frac{\\pi }{3}-0)\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{-1}\\frac{\\pi }{3{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-2}^{-1}\\frac{\\pi }{3{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}y & ={[-\\frac{\\pi }{3y}]}_{-2}^{-1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\pi }{3\\cdot (-1)}-(-\\frac{\\pi }{3\\cdot (-2)}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{3}-\\frac{\\pi }{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-37951/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "16601513-9b74-5cec-9af6-2d99b98e1ab3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-37951"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72268/selection/76c690f03fbd5162fa21765f31a2046fdb1ba896a35e9b165f53f25a86cd1745" :answer/id #uuid "fa0cb47f-7864-5275-9ef6-ebe404085f24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72268/selection/814a4f8b6eb07e70805b4d8da2475e9311e91287e9a4e1559121523e543d7c50" :answer/id #uuid "473ef58a-aede-537e-abbb-0ea50eef2b83" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1+\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72268/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer/id #uuid "a5382880-63f0-50b0-b377-c1a56ac355f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72268/selection/d44fa83f843bb931c0b15366ccb7045f22182cdf2f75578a0b832fc9f01f36a7" :answer/id #uuid "cfb245f5-1151-536f-9a8f-7dbfa203ecef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2-\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72268/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d" :answer/id #uuid "f068f0ef-25d5-5d1a-91f1-e53e594733bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72268/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2160c74f-18e4-5bd0-9363-acbce1ea89ef" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72268/selection/d44fa83f843bb931c0b15366ccb7045f22182cdf2f75578a0b832fc9f01f36a7" :answer-field/choices ["q-72268/selection/76c690f03fbd5162fa21765f31a2046fdb1ba896a35e9b165f53f25a86cd1745" "q-72268/selection/814a4f8b6eb07e70805b4d8da2475e9311e91287e9a4e1559121523e543d7c50" "q-72268/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" "q-72268/selection/d44fa83f843bb931c0b15366ccb7045f22182cdf2f75578a0b832fc9f01f36a7" "q-72268/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72268" :question/id #uuid "293ef1c7-f62c-513e-bea6-e158b705aac2" :question/math-academy-id "q-72268" :question/problem "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le \\frac{\\pi }{2},\\,0\\le y\\le \\frac{\\pi }{4}}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:    \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}[{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,[\\operatorname{sin}⁡x]_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡y(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0))\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡y(1-0)\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡y\\,\\text{d}y & =-2[\\operatorname{cos}⁡y]_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =-2(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =-2\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-2\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =2-\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72268/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d237f9fb-b5d2-53e0-bc28-ee50d9e08852"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72268"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72264/selection/4cbf4aab0a6270ac735ee751239e87352119b4c160ef4e168ba960ee99b1daca" :answer/id #uuid "51445954-0d02-57fe-befe-1600ffeed056" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{2}-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72264/selection/a2301b8122c312044fb5dc0b0c60c599b4f2f7f4ffcc198c9893873ab9165c9d" :answer/id #uuid "0470a115-cad7-5479-85e1-cce013f00e15" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72264/selection/f3d5dec72d1b078389868098b061f26cdf197bdf20c5433f7487e1104f5d6ae9" :answer/id #uuid "b7cf1930-a260-5691-9779-acf4636e844d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{4}-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72264/selection/ace37c2040207cebb14b55c05840a4c383db24d63f2349cf49f8db6a85f5faeb" :answer/id #uuid "7b73bf84-6512-598d-bbd2-a0dbb36a6c80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "e-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72264/selection/f8da8e04f79d501004a2b6968b4efe96af3e12326ce746122141321f6b06a617" :answer/id #uuid "98762fed-4d43-595e-b2fb-0686e391000a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{2}+2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72264/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1cdf5993-5f63-5411-abaa-bfdd4653edbc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72264/selection/f3d5dec72d1b078389868098b061f26cdf197bdf20c5433f7487e1104f5d6ae9" :answer-field/choices ["q-72264/selection/4cbf4aab0a6270ac735ee751239e87352119b4c160ef4e168ba960ee99b1daca" "q-72264/selection/a2301b8122c312044fb5dc0b0c60c599b4f2f7f4ffcc198c9893873ab9165c9d" "q-72264/selection/f3d5dec72d1b078389868098b061f26cdf197bdf20c5433f7487e1104f5d6ae9" "q-72264/selection/ace37c2040207cebb14b55c05840a4c383db24d63f2349cf49f8db6a85f5faeb" "q-72264/selection/f8da8e04f79d501004a2b6968b4efe96af3e12326ce746122141321f6b06a617"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72264" :question/id #uuid "31325216-3d29-50c0-9808-63f126bc97f9" :question/math-academy-id "q-72264" :question/problem "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 4}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}[{e}^{xy}]_{0}^{1}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}({e}^{1\\cdot y}-{e}^{0\\cdot y})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}({e}^{y}-1)\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{4}({e}^{y}-1)\\text{d}y & =[{e}^{y}-y]_{0}^{4} \\\\  & =({e}^{4}-4)-({e}^{0}-0)\\text{ } \\\\  & ={e}^{4}-4-1 \\\\  & ={e}^{4}-5\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72264/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d237f9fb-b5d2-53e0-bc28-ee50d9e08852"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72264"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72197/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "54156bc8-7316-55b1-9557-c9baa00594b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72197/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "2f6e613c-a3bf-5ef9-9620-12b3e1fab9fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72197/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" :answer/id #uuid "be383f3d-3dfb-5455-be08-5ad3592f092b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72197/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "56783d26-7ea9-58ce-bf49-c5ff3cf187f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72197/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "363694f2-1fb0-5b9b-980f-d61fd9cd90ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72197/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8af86ba6-5b96-5391-bec4-a98d51d985ea" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72197/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer-field/choices ["q-72197/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-72197/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" "q-72197/selection/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" "q-72197/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-72197/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72197" :question/id #uuid "3eb8c440-ada3-5253-b326-b8092210096c" :question/math-academy-id "q-72197" :question/problem "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}xy\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 1}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}xy\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}xy\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}xy\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}y[{\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}y{[\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}]}_{0}^{1}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}y(\\frac{{1}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{0}^{2}}{2})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{y}{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{y}{2}\\,\\text{d}y & ={[\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{{1}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{0}^{2}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72197/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d237f9fb-b5d2-53e0-bc28-ee50d9e08852"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72197"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72267/selection/6f12d43b63c09c0722a23ee0df2867181179835f13e5c84d870ebe27e99f46aa" :answer/id #uuid "5bc1a623-857c-53ad-a2db-9d1d6b81fd80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{3}+{e}^{2}+e+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72267/selection/8eeeda97d96cff5c4d93250b26453a5b2abea67c1fd15bba2cc7c65b39f62da6" :answer/id #uuid "ffe34107-b4fd-5b4b-9098-ad46a65022e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{3}+{e}^{2}-e-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72267/selection/a560e07844eeac857b47d6713e4ccc2c918b0572ab31b51fc5e46921b8f7d5ab" :answer/id #uuid "97ff462d-b1a7-56c8-95df-3d44d80c4291" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{3}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72267/selection/389492fd1d905a527b0414c1b9afc3d9ec269aaf2bd988ab355d4ff433adf316" :answer/id #uuid "3aa4efda-8a77-5084-89df-bcfb29035295" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{3}-{e}^{2}-e+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72267/selection/24c896eeb2ecb5b012ca8c9d4b45c1fc640cbbf4054ec86ca43ad228b1096513" :answer/id #uuid "a68f8bc5-7807-577b-86fd-c9f7ef986aae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{3}-{e}^{2}+e-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72267/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5f30f112-94db-5290-8ef2-bd50992d56cc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72267/selection/389492fd1d905a527b0414c1b9afc3d9ec269aaf2bd988ab355d4ff433adf316" :answer-field/choices ["q-72267/selection/6f12d43b63c09c0722a23ee0df2867181179835f13e5c84d870ebe27e99f46aa" "q-72267/selection/8eeeda97d96cff5c4d93250b26453a5b2abea67c1fd15bba2cc7c65b39f62da6" "q-72267/selection/a560e07844eeac857b47d6713e4ccc2c918b0572ab31b51fc5e46921b8f7d5ab" "q-72267/selection/389492fd1d905a527b0414c1b9afc3d9ec269aaf2bd988ab355d4ff433adf316" "q-72267/selection/24c896eeb2ecb5b012ca8c9d4b45c1fc640cbbf4054ec86ca43ad228b1096513"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72267" :question/id #uuid "f26cd789-ba52-54de-bbae-2bbc2a46c9f0" :question/math-academy-id "q-72267" :question/problem "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 2}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:   \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{x+y}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{[{e}^{x+y}]}_{0}^{1}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}({e}^{1+y}-{e}^{0+y})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}({e}^{1+y}-{e}^{y})\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(e{e}^{y}-{e}^{y})\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{e}^{y}(e-1)\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{e}^{y}(e-1)\\text{d}y & =(e-1)[{e}^{y}]_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =(e-1)({e}^{2}-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =(e-1)({e}^{2}-1) \\\\  & ={e}^{3}-{e}^{2}-e+1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72267/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d237f9fb-b5d2-53e0-bc28-ee50d9e08852"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72267"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73591/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "5b610e08-51d9-537a-9828-e333bc48d53e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73591/selection/